{'symbol': 'VTR', 'date': '2022-12-07 19:34:00', 'title': 'VENTAS DECLARES FOURTH QUARTER 2022 DIVIDEND OF $0.45 PER COMMON SHARE', 'text': 'CHICAGO--( BUSINESS WIRE )--VENTAS, INC. (NYSE: VTR) (“VENTAS” OR THE “COMPANY”) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS DECLARED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $0.45 PER COMMON SHARE. THE DIVIDEND WILL BE PAYABLE IN CASH ON JANUARY 19, 2023 TO STOCKHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON JANUARY 3, 2023.'}